Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.28,0:00:19.37,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Furusupiido de mawari hajimeta sutoorii
Dialogue: 1,0:00:19.37,0:00:24.16,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,akaku daichi someageru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.46,0:00:31.71,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Chikyuugi ni wa garandou ni natta paradise
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.71,0:00:36.39,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Bokura no te de sukuidasou
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.34,0:00:43.02,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Hateshinaku tsuzuku sakamichi o
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.02,0:00:47.73,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Ima omoikiri kakenukete far away
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.40,0:00:57.28,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Tachiagare! Yuusha wa boku no naka ni iru
Dialogue: 1,0:00:57.87,0:01:03.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sobietatsu target makeru wake ni wa ikanai
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.04,0:01:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be it to target and that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.18,0:01:03.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we live in and it's not so be it to target
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.66,0:01:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so be it to target for us.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:03.79,0:01:09.79,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Moeagare! Kodou wa mune o kogashiteru
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:12.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to
Dialogue: 1,0:01:09.79,0:01:16.43,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Wasurerareta ashita torimodoshi ni ikun da
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay to keep.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.02,0:01:19.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving until we wake up\Nyour days and I know.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.43,0:01:21.60,Target Karaoke,,0,0,0,,Atsui batoru okose
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.36,0:01:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Imperial Dramon dropped us off in\Ndifferent places around the planet So
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could capture the Digimon and send\Nthem back to the digital world Davis,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.94,0:01:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ken and Matt went to the\NUS where they got to meet
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:41.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Michael's father A real life\Nmovie star Mimi joined them in
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.02,0:01:44.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,New York In Central Park\Nthey ran into Benjamin who
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.38,0:01:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,looks just like Gennai But makes\Na better hot dog Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.48,0:01:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in Hong Kong, Kari, Izzy,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and Jackie and other\NGennai look-alike met up
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.80,0:01:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the Poi brothers to\Nbattle the Digimon there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.16,0:01:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy and the others\Nwent to India where the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:56.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chinese army was about\Nto attack the Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.94,0:01:59.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but Kari came up with a plan to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we all like to travel,\Nbut this is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:03.31,0:02:09.98,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fscx100\fscy100\c&HF7F9F3&\pos(322,328)}Great Battle at Coral and Versailles!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.61,0:02:15.98,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(324,236)}2002/12/25 2PM, Gold Coast, Australia
Dialogue: 1,0:02:11.61,0:02:15.98,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,0)\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(330,439)}(25th 1PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.44,0:02:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure would be nice to spend\Na little time here on the beach,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.36,0:02:17.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But first things first, Digmon, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.72,0:02:18.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:19.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just say the word, Cody.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.78,0:02:22.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon, take care\Nof that control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.26,0:02:23.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.17,0:02:24.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harpoon torpedo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.18,0:02:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Easy there, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save some for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.78,0:02:30.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rock, crack it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.20,0:02:35.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Christmas time, and it's hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sweating more now than the last time\NI got my teeth cleaned at the dentist.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:41.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget we're in Australia, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.32,0:02:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's summer there right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.02,0:02:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On Christmas, you're supposed\Nto wear sweaters, not sunscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.26,0:02:48.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.28,0:02:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like they don't\Nhave a care in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.04,0:02:52.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone else is going nuts, and\Nall they want to do is have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.88,0:02:56.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how things are in\NAustralia, laid back and easygoing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sort of how I used to be before\NI decided to go into medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.08,0:03:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd think they would be a little worried
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about all these control spires popping up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:06.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They probably think there's some kind\Nof lifeguard tower for shark watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's knock them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Cody and I will do the heave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.54,0:03:10.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys do the ho.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.54,0:03:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And heave! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't say go, I said ho! Go? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.60,0:03:17.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ho, ho, ho!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.96,0:03:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did someone say ho, ho, ho?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.16,0:03:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just about to deliver some toys on\Nmy jet ski when I saw you could use a hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Santa Claus on a jet ski?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:27.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should see me on a surfboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.00,0:03:28.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now pull!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.80,0:03:35.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We did it! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.02,0:03:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.56,0:03:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:40.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No time for sipping eggnog now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the Digidestined here in Australia are
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.06,0:03:45.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,leading the Digimon to\Nthe Great Barrier Reef,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.08,0:03:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where the last control spire...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...is still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.32,0:03:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's Gennai!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.90,0:03:52.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, the name's Hogan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.24,0:03:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Gennai's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.56,0:03:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.47,0:03:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.39,0:03:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a boy on that sailboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like he's being chased by a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.78,0:04:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, he's got a Digimon with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.94,0:04:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right, which means that boy's\Na Digidestined just like you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.02,0:04:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a shark chasing him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.12,0:04:16.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's really good\Nwith that sailboard
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.12,0:04:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because he's got free Digimon on his tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.10,0:04:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gazimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.12,0:04:20.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shellmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.36,0:04:22.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ebidramon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.27,0:04:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds like the special at\Nthe Revolving Sushi Bar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:26.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, revolving!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.70,0:04:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got an idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:29.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.11,0:04:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got you, Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.41,0:04:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't just surf!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.50,0:04:34.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put a little spin on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.36,0:04:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.58,0:04:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't even bother drying off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:51.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you won't be staying here that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.66,0:04:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot for the tip, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.14,0:04:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It threw him for a loop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.05,0:04:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Derrick, you bloody Destined.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.04,0:04:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we're the A-team.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.40,0:04:58.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.70,0:05:00.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm Crabmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll use my scissors attack\Non anyone who gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:05.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you need help, call me in a pinch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.22,0:05:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.26,0:05:09.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There'll be time for introductions later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.26,0:05:11.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ikkakumon, are you getting hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.52,0:05:12.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking of having a large\Npizza with Gesomon sausage,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:18.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shellmon pepperoni, and\Nextra Ebidramon cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.10,0:05:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sausage?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.02,0:05:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pepperoni and cheese pizza!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.78,0:05:24.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget the hot sauce!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.10,0:05:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, I bet you could use a bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.02,0:05:33.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm in the mood for a\Ntriple dip Digimon rice pilaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.70,0:05:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Triple dip? Genji-mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.88,0:05:39.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rice peel off!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.52,0:05:45.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crabmon, it's working.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.68,0:05:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you show these guys how\Nwe take care of things down under?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.62,0:05:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of like the rice\Npart, but let's spice it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:52.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Champalaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.26,0:05:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't leave me for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when we're done, we're going to make\Nyou into our favorite dessert, brownie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.36,0:06:06.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ice cream. Pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.92,0:06:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're headed for the Great Barrier Reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.52,0:06:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, you're looking a little green.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.26,0:06:20.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling a bit seasick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.70,0:06:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fortunately, it only happens\Nwhenever I'm around water.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.68,0:06:26.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:28.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Great Barrier Reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.70,0:06:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.26,0:06:31.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The last control spire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.38,0:06:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You worry about those three later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.10,0:06:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, we have to destroy\Nthe control spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.60,0:06:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.51,0:06:42.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon, let him go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that was too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.82,0:06:48.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all this talk about\Nfood, I'm getting hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.54,0:06:50.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say we all go out for...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.82,0:06:55.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, you have to get\Npast me, Scorpiomon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll handle this low-life,\Npenny-pinchin' arachnid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.72,0:07:04.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one calls me arachnid.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's too strong for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.52,0:07:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon, you've got to digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.70,0:07:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, digivolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.72,0:07:15.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ikkakumon, digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, know to the champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're destroying all\Nthe coral in the reef.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:47.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to do something if we\Nlet them keep fighting like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:50.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire barrier reef will be wiped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.24,0:07:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zudomon, underwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, when it comes to\Nwater, you know what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:07.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Armadimon, armor digivolve to...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.58,0:08:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crabmon, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.44,0:08:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crabmon, Crabmon, Crabmon, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.42,0:08:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Golemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.48,0:08:41.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you thought Crabmon was crappy, where\Ndo you see this guy's fossil blight attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll wipe out his enemy's\Nhook, line, and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.90,0:08:48.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submarimon, we have to find a way to\Nlead Scorpiomon away from the coral reef!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.20,0:08:49.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.10,0:09:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oxygen! Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.70,0:09:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to get him to follow me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Erachnid! Erachnid! Erachnid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.78,0:09:19.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vulcan's Hammer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oxygen Torpedo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.88,0:09:35.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, he's out cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.56,0:09:36.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe our attack was too strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.06,0:09:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think he just fainted.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.46,0:09:43.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we can finally\Ndestroy the Control Spire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.08,0:09:48.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm going to take\Na shot at the base of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.24,0:09:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Submarimon, I want you\Nto attack from the side.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.56,0:09:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we can get that fossil bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.94,0:09:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That will work, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.84,0:10:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The other Digidestined have\Nlived the Digimon right to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.88,0:10:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can send them all home and be\Nback in time for the barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:19.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.20,0:10:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think they'll have something mild?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.02,0:10:23.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My stomach's still queasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Digital Gate, open.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.64,0:10:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Derek, I've got another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do they call it Down Under?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:38.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not really under anything.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.46,0:11:00.76,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(322,236)}2002/12/25 4AM, Paris, France
Dialogue: 1,0:10:55.46,0:11:00.76,date 2,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(329,439)}(25th 12PM in Japan)
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.78,0:10:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, check out the Eiffel Tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to be the world's\Ntallest Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.88,0:11:01.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'd love to stand around and look at\Nthe decorations on the Arc de Triomphe,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.30,0:11:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've got two problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, we've got to find the control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And two, I'm freezing out here. TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.16,0:11:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you told me your grandfather, Michel,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.68,0:11:15.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lives here in Paris and would\Nbe willing to lend us a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.08,0:11:16.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.50,0:11:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Tai, if my grandfather\Nsays he's going to do something,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.38,0:11:21.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, eight times out of\Nten, he's going to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.72,0:11:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if this is one of\Nthe other two times?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.70,0:11:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know our way around Paris and\Nneither one of us speaks any French.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:31.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told him this time it was an\Nemergency, so don't worry, he'll be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.30,0:11:32.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.21,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, here comes one of those biker guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he looks pretty mean, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.70,0:11:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:42.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.38,0:11:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to sing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.02,0:11:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.22,0:11:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know you have to sing Fleur\Nde Jacques every time you see me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.58,0:11:52.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, the world's in a lot of danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:54.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The future of Earth depends on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.80,0:11:56.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no time for singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.46,0:11:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Danger or no danger, there's\Nalways time for singing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.82,0:12:04.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Grandpa, why didn't\Nyou bring Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.34,0:12:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She was finishing up some\Nplumbing work in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.60,0:12:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyway, whenever we go for a ride on\Nthis ding, she always insists on driving.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.48,0:12:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a strange feeling things are\Ngoing to get a little rough here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.54,0:12:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This calls for somewhat\Ntough and dominating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.84,0:12:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sounds to me like she's right for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.84,0:12:28.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really care who it is as long as\Nwe find and destroy the control spires.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.18,0:12:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This wasn't how I was planning\Nto spend my Christmas Eve.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.14,0:12:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If all goes well, when\Nwe wake up tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it'll be just as if nothing ever happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.52,0:12:39.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A nice, peaceful Christmas morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:42.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma's putting up a new roof tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.02,0:12:43.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.12,0:12:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She adjusted the brakes last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.56,0:12:49.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you stop, Grandpa?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something is not right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.70,0:12:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.61,0:12:54.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the gate to Versailles Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.48,0:12:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She is wide open.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.82,0:12:59.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And look inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.86,0:13:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no guards and she's all lit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.82,0:13:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on? So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.64,0:13:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's probably being used for one\Nof those secret celebrity weddings.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.62,0:13:07.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.53,0:13:10.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is not one of those rental\Nhalls that serves rubber chicken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.13,0:13:12.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean anything by it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.14,0:13:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was just a joke, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:14.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.36,0:13:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, come on, let's get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.46,0:13:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my responsibility as a Frenchman to\Ninvestigate the matter and if need be,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.98,0:13:21.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to act on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.89,0:13:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So it's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.81,0:13:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.72,0:13:25.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The most important\Nthing to the French is a
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.32,0:13:27.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good bakery and the second\Nis Versailles Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vive la France!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.08,0:13:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, but what am I\Nsupposed to tell Grandma?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.96,0:13:32.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.42,0:13:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If she saw this gate was left unattended,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.28,0:13:35.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she would have someone's\Nhead on a platter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever the gate needs repairs,\Nwho do you think they call?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.70,0:13:40.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.42,0:13:41.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K.?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's call my grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.48,0:13:43.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.46,0:13:44.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's an easy-going guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.28,0:13:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for the Battle of Versailles!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.60,0:13:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, the second one!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.88,0:14:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Mamemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.24,0:14:16.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let his size fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he lacks in height, he makes\Nup for with his smirk bomb attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.38,0:14:25.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Big Mameemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let his size fool you either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.08,0:14:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He looks slow, but watch out\Nfor his big smirk bomb attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.96,0:14:33.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, well then, who's the third one?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.54,0:14:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Metal Mummymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being a cyborg-type Digimon,\Nhe's the strongest of all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His metal smirk bombs are iron-clad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are they some of the Digimon who\Nare putting the world in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.94,0:14:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, they've got a lot of nerve.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.08,0:14:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's one thing to attack the\Nworld, but to invade the Cy Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.68,0:14:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandpa, you've got to\Ncalm down. Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think there's someone else in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.28,0:14:58.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.20,0:15:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.60,0:15:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.36,0:15:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can mean only one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.39,0:15:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a digidestine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.31,0:15:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well. Stand aside.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.72,0:15:22.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You there, Big Mamemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.02,0:15:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bonjour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.93,0:15:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the people\Nof the French Republic,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:29.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I charge you with trespassing, and I'm\Nhereby placing you under citizen's arrest,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.72,0:15:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,n 'est-ce pas?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mademoiselle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would greatly appreciate it if you\Nwould allow me the honor of rescuing you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you join us for\Na little dessert? Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.42,0:15:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's not working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.36,0:16:04.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiki-Ball is getting to a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.10,0:16:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Agumon, Tiki-Ball, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.20,0:16:11.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiki-Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:18.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiki-Ball, you're a\Nsix-month-night-of-champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:22.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiki-Ball, you are a\Nsix-month-night-of-champions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:26.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tiki-Ball is getting to a champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.96,0:16:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon, Digivolve, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.54,0:16:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.34,0:16:40.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, use the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.88,0:16:44.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.84,0:16:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nova Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.24,0:16:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nettlesmetball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fireworks at Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.06,0:17:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.97,0:17:07.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.20,0:17:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.70,0:17:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saved my life. Forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.12,0:17:14.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.44,0:17:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am one of the\NDigidestined here in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.90,0:17:17.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am just grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.81,0:17:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all right. I am fine. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.96,0:17:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Catherine, how did they capture you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.30,0:17:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Floramon and I were trying to destroy\Na control spire near the Seine River.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.34,0:17:29.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one was around.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.68,0:17:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it would be easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.44,0:17:35.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Allergy Shower! Ha-ha-ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.06,0:17:37.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bang, bang, boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.76,0:17:43.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next thing I knew, we were\Nprisoners here in Versailles Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.50,0:17:45.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are lucky to be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.14,0:17:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So the Mamemon brothers aren't\Nthe only Digimon in France.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.08,0:17:49.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parley-vo-gera-mon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't get much nastier\Nthan me, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.26,0:17:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My spinning mine attack\Nwill sink your ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.54,0:18:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little Smurkball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.52,0:18:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How does this feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:08.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spinning mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Smiley Bomber!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.46,0:18:18.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're Ultimates. We can't\Ncompete with them like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koromon, you've got to digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.88,0:18:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better digivolve too, Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.70,0:18:23.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Floramon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Angemon digivolve too!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:34.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon, and the Skiles!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.70,0:18:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill ultimate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.38,0:18:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magna Angemon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.60,0:18:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digital Monsters, Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.38,0:18:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bravery Digimon 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digital Monsters,\NDigimon, and the Champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.10,0:19:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's MetalGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.88,0:19:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoramon, Digivolve to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:15.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kiwimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.96,0:19:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's kick back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.54,0:19:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, big smart man!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.10,0:19:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.10,0:19:26.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get her out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.01,0:19:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on the run!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.93,0:19:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get them down to the\Ncontrol spire by the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.94,0:19:40.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catherine, if you get\Nscared, grab onto me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm closer, so grab me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.48,0:19:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giga Blaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:13.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, guys, I'd say we\Njust saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.78,0:20:16.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Arrow Digidestined are\Nprobably returning home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.88,0:20:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you so\Nmuch you saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.48,0:20:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Grandma's probably remodeled the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.56,0:20:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.10,0:20:24.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.01,0:20:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi-yah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.32,0:20:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gentleman, let me show you the proper way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.38,0:20:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mwah! Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.10,0:20:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mwah! Mwah!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.92,0:20:42.92,date 3,,0,0,0,,{\c&HF1F6EF&\pos(324,235)}2002/12/25 2PM, Tokyo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, your cough sounds really bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:46.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you better go home. I am! Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.16,0:20:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.72,0:20:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.70,0:20:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something scary about that lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.52,0:21:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But somehow it seems\Nlike she understands me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.50,0:21:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find out who she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.92,0:21:29.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The road to the future is a roadway
Dialogue: 1,0:21:25.09,0:21:31.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Asu e mukau kisha wa togireta reeru de
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.54,0:21:37.60,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Mou furikaeru bakari tomadou watashi
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.92,0:21:38.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to turn back on the road.\NI'm going to go together with my hands.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.02,0:21:45.54,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Te to te tsunagi awase issho ni hashiru to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.12,0:21:44.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we're together, we're\Ngoing together with each other.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.54,0:21:52.75,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Sou ookina chikara ga daseru no wa naze?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.16,0:22:03.21,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo tsuuji atteru kara
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.44,0:22:05.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.21,0:22:09.61,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo doko demo tonde ikeru wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.36,0:22:08.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.90,0:22:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to go anywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.22,0:22:17.10,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Itsumo itsumo itsu demo minna ga soba ni iru
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.88,0:22:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not one of those people.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.10,0:22:24.44,Itsumo karaoke,,0,0,0,,Kitto kitto dare demo hitori janai wa
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.48,0:22:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.76,0:22:58.77,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(650,0)\c&HF2F9EE&\pos(321,319)}The Fierce Battle of Love and Borscht!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.22,0:23:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,see me next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.44,0:23:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You

